                <mxCell id="exp_job4_desc" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=14;fontColor=#A7B2C4;" value="• Developed transformer models using EHR data, visit-level embeddings &amp; MedBERT.&#xa;• Built patient enrollment model that improved clinical trial efficiency by 29%." vertex="1">
